            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trail of Destruction is a fast-paced space brawler for up to 4 local or online players and bots. Outsmart your opponents by encircling them with your ship's trail, unleashing powerful abilities, collecting game-changing powerups, and surviving chaotic events in a constantly evolving arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/a061d9aaa674cdeec61fed03689980f8.avif?t=1780589349\" width=1077 height=107 /></span>Skill-Based Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't decided by luck. Master movement, predict your opponents, and use the arena to your advantage to prove who's the better player.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches play out the same. Random events, a dynamic arena, collectible items, and 36 ability combinations create countless opportunities for new strategies and memorable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second matters. Dodge enemy trails, avoid deadly hazards, and seize opportunities before they disappear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players locally, online, or with a combination of both. Prefer flying solo? Challenge AI-controlled players using mouse and keyboard controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/d282ff735bd5e315ea2db1f84f1ac387.avif?t=1780589349\" width=1077 height=107 /></span>Encircle and Destroy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/9ee2128ddc128788ebbf0ce2d74ecdcf.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/9ee2128ddc128788ebbf0ce2d74ecdcf.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/9ee2128ddc128788ebbf0ce2d74ecdcf.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave a trail behind your ship and use it to trap opponents. Complete a circle around an enemy to instantly destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/ff69467306b2794e299bd5c6e109a667.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/ff69467306b2794e299bd5c6e109a667.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/ff69467306b2794e299bd5c6e109a667.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch &amp; Team Deathmatch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points by eliminating opponents during a 5-minute battle. Avoid environmental hazards, capitalize on special events, and finish with the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Ship Standing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player starts with a limited number of lives. Stay alive longer than everyone else to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/e4133c67b8ca80c3d946bd2c1df65ffb.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/e4133c67b8ca80c3d946bd2c1df65ffb.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/e4133c67b8ca80c3d946bd2c1df65ffb.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one offensive and one defensive ability for your ship. Mix and match from 6 offensive and 6 defensive abilities to create 36 unique loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/57fe9e91f10783b55d926af65e98f1d9.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/57fe9e91f10783b55d926af65e98f1d9.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/57fe9e91f10783b55d926af65e98f1d9.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful abilities to outmaneuver, outsmart, and destroy your opponents. Perfect timing can turn certain defeat into victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/39f2f5dc6a3cc6518091d4adbd17312e.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/39f2f5dc6a3cc6518091d4adbd17312e.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/39f2f5dc6a3cc6518091d4adbd17312e.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is constantly changing. Arena sections transform throughout the match, forcing players to adapt and rethink their strategies on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/a6a7b57c218f90b36e6d3dc12e6de073.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/a6a7b57c218f90b36e6d3dc12e6de073.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/a6a7b57c218f90b36e6d3dc12e6de073.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected. Special events can dramatically alter the course of a match. During the Laser Event, for example, a massive laser sweeps across the arena, destroying any ship caught in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game-Changing Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/d48f5484d6134d5c9c96da73c7d1f1b3.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/d48f5484d6134d5c9c96da73c7d1f1b3.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/d48f5484d6134d5c9c96da73c7d1f1b3.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items scattered throughout the arena to gain powerful effects and create new opportunities. Securing them can be just as important as hunting your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Singularity”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Vitalezzz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License: CC0 1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“RailJet / Long Seamless Loop”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Deceased Superior Technician (DST)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License: CC BY 3.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Frozen Jam (Seamless Loop)”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Elle Trudgett</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >edited by qubodup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License: CC BY 3.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Awake! (Megawall-10)”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by cynicmusic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License: CC0 1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Flying me softly”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Alexandr Zhelanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License: CC BY 3.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Space Chase”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Szymon Matuszewski</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License: CC BY 3.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trail of Destruction is a fast-paced space brawler for up to 4 local or online players and bots. Outsmart your opponents by encircling them with your ship's trail, unleashing powerful abilities, collecting game-changing powerups, and surviving chaotic events in a constantly evolving arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/a061d9aaa674cdeec61fed03689980f8.avif?t=1780589349\" width=1077 height=107 /></span>Skill-Based Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't decided by luck. Master movement, predict your opponents, and use the arena to your advantage to prove who's the better player.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches play out the same. Random events, a dynamic arena, collectible items, and 36 ability combinations create countless opportunities for new strategies and memorable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second matters. Dodge enemy trails, avoid deadly hazards, and seize opportunities before they disappear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players locally, online, or with a combination of both. Prefer flying solo? Challenge AI-controlled players using mouse and keyboard controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/d282ff735bd5e315ea2db1f84f1ac387.avif?t=1780589349\" width=1077 height=107 /></span>Encircle and Destroy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/9ee2128ddc128788ebbf0ce2d74ecdcf.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/9ee2128ddc128788ebbf0ce2d74ecdcf.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/9ee2128ddc128788ebbf0ce2d74ecdcf.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave a trail behind your ship and use it to trap opponents. Complete a circle around an enemy to instantly destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/ff69467306b2794e299bd5c6e109a667.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/ff69467306b2794e299bd5c6e109a667.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/ff69467306b2794e299bd5c6e109a667.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch &amp; Team Deathmatch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points by eliminating opponents during a 5-minute battle. Avoid environmental hazards, capitalize on special events, and finish with the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Ship Standing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player starts with a limited number of lives. Stay alive longer than everyone else to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/e4133c67b8ca80c3d946bd2c1df65ffb.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/e4133c67b8ca80c3d946bd2c1df65ffb.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/e4133c67b8ca80c3d946bd2c1df65ffb.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one offensive and one defensive ability for your ship. Mix and match from 6 offensive and 6 defensive abilities to create 36 unique loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/57fe9e91f10783b55d926af65e98f1d9.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/57fe9e91f10783b55d926af65e98f1d9.webm?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/57fe9e91f10783b55d926af65e98f1d9.mp4?t=1780589349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful abilities to outmaneuver, outsmart, and destroy your opponents. Perfect timing can turn certain defeat into victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extras/39f2f5dc6a3cc6518091d4adbd17312e.poster.avif?t=1780589349\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/633430/extra